# AI Chat App (Ollama + Python)

This is a simple desktop AI chat application built with Python and PySide6.  
It connects to a local Ollama server to generate AI responses.

---

## Requirements

### 1. Create virtual environment (only first time)
python -m venv env

### 2. Activate the environment (Linux and macOS):
source env/bin/activate

### 2. Activate the environment (Windows):
env\Scripts\activate.bat

### 3. Install dependencies using:
pip install -r requirements.txt

